<article class="env-definition" id="0ADP">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0ADP">Definition <span data-tag="0ADP">74.22.9</span>.</a> With $\mathcal{U}' = \{ X'_ i \to X'\} _{i \in I'}$, $\mathcal{U} = \{ X_ i \to X\} _{i \in I}$, $\alpha : I' \to I$, $g : X' \to X$, and $g_ i : X'_ i \to X_{\alpha (i)}$ as in Lemma <a href="/tag/0ADN" data-tag="0ADN">74.22.8</a> the functor </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  (V_ i, \varphi _{ij}) \longmapsto (g_ i^*V_{\alpha (i)}, (g_ i \times g_ j)^*\varphi _{\alpha (i) \alpha (j)})  \]
</div>
  <p> constructed in that lemma is called the <em>pullback functor</em> on descent data. </p>
</article>